    "Money": {
      "description": "AX-014 — an amount as a number plus a currency.\n\n``Money(amount=3240.00, currency=\"EUR\")`` is valid. A formatted string\nsuch as ``\"€3,240.00\"`` is refused: the number and the currency arrive\napart.",
